        "col_3": "Lapik Travel Set",
        "col_4": "Lapik Knee Cushion Rug",
        "footnote": "Lapik weights and sizes are from supplier specifications and our own sample checks. Pocket-mat figures are typical of S$3 to 6 marketplace listings.",
