    "story": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Lapik",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Lapik is a Malay word for an underlay: the thing you put beneath you so what is beneath stays clean. It is also what a prayer mat is, and we thought it deserved a better version than the S$5 one that slides across the office floor.</p><p>We are a small Singapore store. We pick a few mats, check them ourselves, and ship them here in 5 to 10 days.</p>"
          }
        },
